nter\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:center;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-autospace:\nideograph-numeric ideograph-other;word-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:\n10.0pt;font-family:나눔고딕;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">바로 여기<span lang=\"EN-US\">! </span>제<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>회 계룡장학재단 아이디어 공모전을 주목해주세요<span lang=\"EN-US\">.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:center;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-autospace:\nideograph-numeric ideograph-other;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:나눔고딕;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:center;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-autospace:\nideograph-numeric ideograph-other;word-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:\n10.0pt;font-family:나눔고딕;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">내가 상상하는 서울의\n새로운 랜드마크의 모습<span lang=\"EN-US\">,<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:center;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-autospace:\nideograph-numeric ideograph-other;word-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:\n10.0pt;font-family:나눔고딕;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">바운더리 내 숨은\n매력을 보여주는 영상<span lang=\"EN-US\">,<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:center;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-autospace:\nideograph-numeric ideograph-other;word-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:\n10.0pt;font-family:나눔고딕;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">서울을 핫플로 만들\n수 있는 방법을 담은 기획안<span lang=\"EN-US\">,<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:center;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-autospace:\nideograph-numeric ideograph-other;word-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:\n10.0pt;font-family:나눔고딕;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">어쩌면 내 머릿속에\n있는 아무말 대잔치가 담긴 네이밍 아이디어까지<span lang=\"EN-US\">!<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:center;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-autospace:\nideograph-numeric ideograph-other;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:나눔고딕;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:center;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-autospace:\nideograph-numeric ideograph-other;word-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:\n10.0pt;font-family:나눔고딕;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">어떤 아이디어든<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>어떤 표현이든 모든 게 다 가능한 여러분들의 아이디어를 기다립니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;\nline-height:107%;font-family:나눔고딕;color:black;letter-spacing:-.2pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;\nfont-family:나눔고딕;color:#4174D9;letter-spacing:-.2pt\">● 참가 자격</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:나눔고딕;\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:-.2pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;\nline-height:107%;font-family:나눔고딕;color:black;letter-spacing:-.2pt\">&nbsp; - </span><span s